#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/zensical.rst:7
msgid ""
"Zensical_ is a static site generator for project documentation, built by the"
" creators of Material for MkDocs."
msgstr "Zensical_ 是一个用于项目文档的静态站点生成器，由 Material for MkDocs 的创建者开发。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/zensical.rst:10
msgid ""
"Read the Docs builds your Zensical site on every push, previews your pull "
"requests, and hosts every version of your documentation."
msgstr "Read the Docs 会在每次推送时构建你的 Zensical 站点、预览 Pull Request，并托管你文档的每个版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/zensical.rst:14
msgid ""
"Minimal configuration is required to build an existing Zensical project on "
"Read the Docs:"
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上构建现有 Zensical 项目所需的配置极少："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/zensical.rst:16
msgid ".readthedocs.yaml"
msgstr ".readthedocs.yaml"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/zensical.rst:38
msgid "For a complete example, see our `Zensical example repository`_."
msgstr "有关完整示例，请参阅我们的 `Zensical example repository`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/zensical.rst:44
