msgid ""
"Zensical doesn't support variable interpolation in its configuration file, "
"so you need to set the value explicitly instead of using the "
":envvar:`READTHEDOCS_CANONICAL_URL` environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Zensical 不支持在其配置文件中进行变量插值，因此你需要显式设置该值，而不能使用 "
":envvar:`READTHEDOCS_CANONICAL_URL` 环境变量。"

